      "id": "KT-settlement-trade-lien-controls:2",
      "section": "LIEN notification reprocessing",
      "claim_scope": "New LIEN can reprocess WAITING/Pending Exception, HOLD, and READY cashflows lacking the exception.\nIt can trigger unnetting only when the resultant lacks LIEN and remains outside protected released-like states.\nProtected states include READY/Pending Ack, RELEASED, and SETTLED.\nA later trade notification must handle cashflows received before the trade update.",
